---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const breadcrumbJsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    {
      '@type': 'ListItem',
      position: 1,
      name: 'Home',
      item: 'https://strovagroups.in/',
    },
    {
      '@type': 'ListItem',
      position: 2,
      name: 'Cookie Policy',
      item: 'https://strovagroups.in/cookies/',
    },
  ],
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cookie Policy — Strova Group"
  description="Transparent cookie policy for Strova Group. Zero tracking cookies on the marketing site; essential auth cookies only on the client portal."
  jsonLd={[breadcrumbJsonLd]}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">Privacy &amp; Data</span>
      <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">Last updated: October 12, 2026</p>

      <p>
        <strong>Strova Group</strong> believes in privacy by design and radical transparency. This Cookie Policy explains how cookies and browser storage technologies are used on our marketing website (<a href="https://strovagroups.in">https://strovagroups.in</a>) and client portal (<a href="https://strovagroups.in/portal/">https://strovagroups.in/portal</a>).
      </p>

      <h2>1. Marketing Website</h2>
      <p>
        On our public marketing website (<code>strovagroups.in</code>), we <strong>do not set any tracking cookies, third-party advertising cookies, or behavioral profiling cookies</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        The current site code does not configure a third-party analytics provider. Hosting, security, and embedded services may use their own technical storage as configured.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Client Portal</h2>
      <p>
        The invite-only client portal uses Supabase browser authentication. Its session is persisted in browser storage by the Supabase client, rather than an HttpOnly cookie.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Security / Bot Verification:</strong> Cloudflare Turnstile security tokens during authentication to protect against automated credential attacks.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Sign out after using a shared device and protect access to your browser profile.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Payment Gateway Modal Storage (Razorpay)</h2>
      <p>
        When a client authorizes payment for an invoice in the Client Portal via Razorpay, transient security tokens and session state are managed strictly within Razorpay's secure checkout modal iframe. These elements are required to detect payment fraud, securely handle UPI / 3D-Secure card verification, and maintain transaction integrity. Strova Group never accesses or stores payment instrument details or CVVs.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Local Storage &amp; Cache</h2>
      <p>
        The portal stores its authenticated session in browser storage. The public site also uses local storage for a visitor-selected theme preference. Your browser may cache static site assets.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Managing Your Privacy Choices</h2>
      <p id="privacy-choices">
        You can control or delete cookies and local storage directly through your browser settings:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>You may clear your browser cache and local storage at any time via your browser settings.</li>
        <li>You can configure your browser to block third-party cookies or alert you when cookies are being sent.</li>
        <li>Logging out of the client portal signs out the Supabase session and clears its locally persisted authentication state.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. Inquiries &amp; Data Principal Rights</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about our cookie policy or wish to exercise your data principal rights under India's Digital Personal Data Protection (DPDP) Act 2023, you may submit a request online:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Online Rights Desk:</strong> <a href="/privacy/requests/">Submit a Privacy Request &rarr;</a></li>
        <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@strovagroups.in">info@strovagroups.in</a></li>
        <li><strong>Phone &amp; WhatsApp:</strong> <a href="tel:+919288077802">+91 92880 77802</a></li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-sm text-muted" style="margin-top: var(--space-8);">
        Strova Group is a proprietorship of Babita Kumari. Registered MSME: UDYAM-JH-20-0147452.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

